---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Bring a Launch Kit into Composer" description="Inspect a locally generated identity package, review the proposed branding and adopt selected fields into a separate app draft.">
<h1>Make this identity yours.</h1><p class="lede">Choose the ZIP you prepared in Launch Kit. Inspect the actual assets, then choose what to use. Your existing Init and content-model drafts stay intact.</p>
<p><a href="/launch-kit">Open Launch Kit</a> · <a href="/init">Return to Init</a></p>
<label>Launch Kit package<input type="file" accept=".zip,application/zip" id="kit-file"/></label><p id="kit-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a package up to 8 MiB. Reading it stays on this device.</p>
<section id="kit-review" hidden><h2>Review the proposed changes.</h2><p id="kit-summary"></p><div id="kit-images" class="kit-images"></div><form id="kit-fields"><fieldset><legend>Use these fields in the app draft</legend><label><input type="checkbox" name="title" checked/>Title <span id="kit-title"></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="subtitle" checked/>Subtitle <span id="kit-subtitle"></span></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="icons" checked/>Browser, touch and app icons with web manifest</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="social" checked/>Social image and its description</label></fieldset><p id="kit-previous"></p><div class="actions"><button type="submit">Adopt selected branding</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="kit-cancel">Keep current draft</button></div></form><details><summary>Inspect source identity and output hashes</summary><pre id="kit-inventory"></pre></details></section>
<section id="kit-adopted" hidden><h2>Imported into an app draft.</h2><p id="kit-adopted-summary"></p><p>The package is retained only in this browser after your deliberate adoption. Download the adoption record and keep the original ZIP alongside it. Your agent can apply them to a working independent listening timer or a new EmDash content app; an existing project is never overwritten.</p><div class="actions"><button id="kit-download" class="secondary">Download adoption record</button><button id="kit-copy">Copy app-creation request</button><button id="kit-forget" class="secondary">Remove this local app draft</button></div><pre id="kit-handoff"></pre><p><a href="/init/content">Configure the app’s content fields</a> · <a href="/launch-kit/example/">Open the served fictional reference</a> · <a href="https://share.loftwah.com">Inspect the reference with Link Check</a></p><p class="small">Imported is not applied, deployed or inspected. Those actions require the reviewed app creation and release workflow.</p></section>
<script src="../../lib/launch-kit-client.ts"></script>
</Base>
<style>.kit-images{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-block:24px}.kit-images :global(canvas){max-width:100%;object-fit:contain}.kit-images :global(canvas:first-child){width:96px;height:96px}.kit-images :global(canvas:last-child){width:420px;height:auto}#kit-fields label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px}#kit-fields input{width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}#kit-fields span{overflow-wrap:anywhere}#kit-handoff{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}section{margin-top:32px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}</style>
